<Property name="MatchLdapLocationsWithPV1">
<Description>
If this is set as true the location returned from LDAP are matched against the PV1:3.2
and if the match is found the transaction is forwarded to the target other wise skipped.
If this is unchecked the match is not done. If it is unknown provider the match is always done.</Description>
<Type>%Boolean</Type>
